  "description": "Ha Docheol recognizes Yidam's beauty and potential through a video for a group project at school. Han Yidam, who desperately needs money, is drawn in by his editing skills and is offered a chance to debut as a streamer, eventually giving in to the temptation. Starting a double life in secret from her school, Docheol joins her as her manager and editor, determined to bet her entire life on this game where a single donation can turn everything upside down.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
